# Firmitas frontend — production build (`npm run build`).
#
# Replace this with the deployed Firmitas backend origin before shipping.
# It must point at THIS project's backend — never at another project's API.
# Do not leave a localhost value here: the built bundle would call the
# visitor's own machine.
VITE_API_URL=https://REPLACE-WITH-YOUR-FIRMITAS-BACKEND/api
